Common ResponseChoice
    documentation "An individual choice within a list of possible responses to a survey question."
    integer SortOrder
        documentation "Sort order of this ResponseChoice within the complete list of choices attached to a SurveyQuestion. If sort order doesn't apply, the value of NumericValue or a unique, possibly sequential numeric value."
        is part of identity
    shared integer NumericValue
        documentation "A valid numeric response. If paired with a TextValue, the numeric equivalent of the TextValue."
        is optional
    shared string TextValue
        documentation "A valid text response. If paired with a NumericValue, the text equivalent of the NumericValue."
        is optional
